<rss xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:content="http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/" version="2.0"><channel><title>彭博社 实时热点</title><link>https://feeds.bloomberg.com/markets/news.rss</link><description>彭博社 自动中文翻译源</description><docs>http://www.rssboard.org/rss-specification</docs><generator>python-feedgen</generator><lastBuildDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 00:43:17 +0000</lastBuildDate><item><title>Advent 考虑收购测试公司 Bureau Veritas</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/advent-weighs-takeover-of-testing-firm-bureau-veritas</link><description>据知情人士透露，Advent 正在考虑收购法国测试公司 Bureau Veritas SA，这将是今年欧洲公司最大的收购之一。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/advent-weighs-takeover-of-testing-firm-bureau-veritas'&gt;Advent 考虑收购测试公司 Bureau Veritas&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Advent Weighs Takeover Of Testing Firm Bureau Veritas&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/advent-weighs-takeover-of-testing-firm-bureau-veritas</guid><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 19:58:23 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>Butterball 首席执行官谈感恩节晚餐展望</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-24/butterball-ceo-on-thanksgiving-dinner-outlook-video</link><description>Butterball 首席执行官 Jay Jandrain 表示，美国火鸡产量略高于去年，节日火鸡价格与往年基本一致。一些零售商提供的火鸡优惠价格低于去年的价格，感恩节餐篮的价格可能与去年相同或更低。詹德瑞恩表示，零售商决定是否对产品打折以吸引购物者，而巴特鲍尔则对促销活动表示欢迎。他在“The Close”节目中与罗曼·博斯蒂克进行了交谈。 （来源：彭博社）&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-24/butterball-ceo-on-thanksgiving-dinner-outlook-video'&gt;Butterball 首席执行官谈感恩节晚餐展望&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Butterball CEO on Thanksgiving Dinner Outlook&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-24/butterball-ceo-on-thanksgiving-dinner-outlook-video</guid><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 23:12:17 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>美国准备对中国和欧盟商品加征关税</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-24/us-readies-tariff-hike-on-china-eu-goods-video-mwvca1k8</link><description>据知情人士透露，美国将宣布计划提高来自中国、欧盟和其他十几个经济体的商品关税。彭博社的德里克·沃尔班克 (Derek Wallbank) 发布了最新消息。 （来源：彭博社）&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-24/us-readies-tariff-hike-on-china-eu-goods-video-mwvca1k8'&gt;美国准备对中国和欧盟商品加征关税&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：US Readies Tariff Hike on China, EU Goods&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-24/us-readies-tariff-hike-on-china-eu-goods-video-mwvca1k8</guid><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 23:41:59 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>澳洲联储雅各布斯表示加息后金融状况“受到​​限制”</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/rba-s-jacobs-says-financial-conditions-restrictive-after-hikes</link><description>一位储备银行高级官员表示，在今年五次加息之后，澳大利亚的金融状况“明显受到限制”，同时也指出确定加息幅度的难度。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/rba-s-jacobs-says-financial-conditions-restrictive-after-hikes'&gt;澳洲联储雅各布斯表示加息后金融状况“受到​​限制”&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：RBA’s Jacobs Says Financial Conditions ‘Restrictive’ After Hikes&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/rba-s-jacobs-says-financial-conditions-restrictive-after-hikes</guid><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 23:50:00 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>11 月 25 日最新石油市场新闻和分析</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/latest-oil-market-news-and-analysis-for-nov-25</link><description>由于交易商权衡供应增加的迹象与霍尔木兹海峡周围船只遭受的袭击升级，油价下跌。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/latest-oil-market-news-and-analysis-for-nov-25'&gt;11 月 25 日最新石油市场新闻和分析&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Latest Oil Market News and Analysis for Nov. 25&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/latest-oil-market-news-and-analysis-for-nov-25</guid><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 23:06:29 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>HDBank 向全球投资者提供债券和贷款，为越南的增长提供资金</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/hdbank-turns-to-global-investors-with-bonds-loan-to-fund-growth-in-vietnam</link><description>胡志明市发展股份公司计划出售全球债券并通过银团贷款市场借款，向海外投资者寻求帮助，以满足追求雄心勃勃的增长目标的经济体不断增长的信贷需求。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/hdbank-turns-to-global-investors-with-bonds-loan-to-fund-growth-in-vietnam'&gt;HDBank 向全球投资者提供债券和贷款，为越南的增长提供资金&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：HDBank Turns to Global Investors With Bonds, Loan to Fund Growth in Vietnam&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/hdbank-turns-to-global-investors-with-bonds-loan-to-fund-growth-in-vietnam</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>由于人工智能贸易疑虑重新浮现，亚洲股市下跌：市场总结</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/asian-stocks-to-slide-as-ai-trade-doubts-resurface-markets-wrap</link><description>美国科技股再次遭到抛售，再次引发人们对人工智能行业持久性的怀疑，亚洲股市追随华尔街的跌幅而回落。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/asian-stocks-to-slide-as-ai-trade-doubts-resurface-markets-wrap'&gt;由于人工智能贸易疑虑重新浮现，亚洲股市下跌：市场总结&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Asian Stocks Fall as AI Trade Doubts Resurface: Markets Wrap&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/asian-stocks-to-slide-as-ai-trade-doubts-resurface-markets-wrap</guid><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 22:09:18 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>美国关税计划强化加息押注，金价保持下跌</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/gold-holds-decline-as-us-tariff-plans-reinforce-rate-hike-bets</link><description>在白宫最新的关税计划导致股市走低并强化了美联储加息的预期之后，金价保持下跌。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/gold-holds-decline-as-us-tariff-plans-reinforce-rate-hike-bets'&gt;美国关税计划强化加息押注，金价保持下跌&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Gold Holds Decline as US Tariff Plans Reinforce Rate-Hike Bets&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/gold-holds-decline-as-us-tariff-plans-reinforce-rate-hike-bets</guid><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 23:51:22 +0000</pubDate></item></channel></rss>